{"type":"message","id":"190693e0","parentId":"bb98350c","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:30.953Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_35vwvgz9tg10_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 28\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 16:59 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 one one 4096 Feb 26 17:04 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 6928 Feb 26 16:59 app.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2058 Feb 26 16:58 index.html\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 5473 Feb 26 16:59 style.css"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":9,"aggregated":"total 28\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 16:59 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 one one 4096 Feb 26 17:04 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 6928 Feb 26 16:59 app.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2058 Feb 26 16:58 index.html\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 5473 Feb 26 16:59 style.css","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/code-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772103210950}}
{"type":"message","id":"e4e09c7b","parentId":"190693e0","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:34.566Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me read all three files to understand the current state of the frontend.","thinkingSignature":"f4cf2f70305297e6e01368c0f19daf42fd27edb32a059f05bca97cc09e0f8763"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/static/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/static/app.js"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/static/style.css"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":789,"output":109,"cacheRead":7681,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8579,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772103210953}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e96c7fd","parentId":"e4e09c7b","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:34.596Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>待办事项</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"header\">\n            <h1>📝 待办事项</h1>\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n                <span class=\"completed-count\">已完成: 0</span>\n                <span class=\"separator\">/</span>\n                <span class=\"total-count\">总数: 0</span>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Input Area -->\n        <div class=\"input-area\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"todo-input\" placeholder=\"添加新任务...\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n            <button id=\"add-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">添加</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Todo List -->\n        <ul id=\"todo-list\" class=\"todo-list\">\n            <!-- Tasks will be rendered here -->\n        </ul>\n\n        <!-- Empty State -->\n        <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"empty-state hidden\">\n            <p>暂无待办事项</p>\n            <p class=\"sub-text\">在上方添加你的第一个任务吧</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Edit Modal -->\n    <div id=\"edit-modal\" class=\"modal hidden\">\n        <div class=\"modal-content\">\n            <div class=\"modal-header\">\n                <h2>编辑任务</h2>\n                <button class=\"close-btn\" id=\"close-modal\">&times;</button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"modal-body\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"edit-title\" placeholder=\"任务标题\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n                <textarea id=\"edit-description\" placeholder=\"任务描述（可选）\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"cancel-edit\">取消</button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"save-edit\">保存</button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772103214594}}
{"type":"message","id":"c4b00604","parentId":"0e96c7fd","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:34.601Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// API Base URL\nconst API_BASE = '';\n\n// State\nlet todos = [];\nlet editingId = null;\n\n// DOM Elements\nconst todoInput = document.getElementById('todo-input');\nconst addBtn = document.getElementById('add-btn');\nconst todoList = document.getElementById('todo-list');\nconst emptyState = document.getElementById('empty-state');\nconst completedCount = document.querySelector('.completed-count');\nconst totalCount = document.querySelector('.total-count');\nconst editModal = document.getElementById('edit-modal');\nconst editTitle = document.getElementById('edit-title');\nconst editDescription = document.getElementById('edit-description');\nconst closeModal = document.getElementById('close-modal');\nconst cancelEdit = document.getElementById('cancel-edit');\nconst saveEdit = document.getElementById('save-edit');\n\n// Initialize\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    fetchTodos();\n    setupEventListeners();\n});\n\n// Event Listeners\nfunction setupEventListeners() {\n    // Add todo\n    addBtn.addEventListener('click', createTodo);\n    todoInput.addEventListener('keypress', (e) => {\n        if (e.key === 'Enter') createTodo();\n    });\n\n    // Modal events\n    closeModal.addEventListener('click', closeModalFunc);\n    cancelEdit.addEventListener('click', closeModalFunc);\n    saveEdit.addEventListener('click', saveTodoEdit);\n    \n    // Close modal on backdrop click\n    editModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n        if (e.target === editModal) closeModalFunc();\n    });\n\n    // Close modal on Escape key\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n        if (e.key === 'Escape' && !editModal.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n            closeModalFunc();\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// API Functions\nasync function fetchTodos() {\n    try {\n        const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/todos`);\n        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to fetch todos');\n        todos = await response.json();\n        renderTodos();\n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error fetching todos:', error);\n    }\n}\n\nasync function createTodo() {\n    const title = todoInput.value.trim();\n    if (!title) return;\n\n    try {\n        const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/todos`, {\n            method: 'POST',\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n            body: JSON.stringify({ title })\n        });\n        \n        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to create todo');\n        \n        const newTodo = await response.json();\n        todos.push(newTodo);\n        todoInput.value = '';\n        renderTodos();\n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error creating todo:', error);\n    }\n}\n\nasync function toggleTodo(id) {\n    const todo = todos.find(t => t.id === id);\n    if (!todo) return;\n\n    try {\n        const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/todos/${id}`, {\n            method: 'PUT',\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n            body: JSON.stringify({ completed: !todo.completed })\n        });\n\n        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to update todo');\n\n        const updatedTodo = await response.json();\n        const index = todos.findIndex(t => t.id === id);\n        todos[index] = updatedTodo;\n        renderTodos();\n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error toggling todo:', error);\n    }\n}\n\nasync function deleteTodo(id) {\n    if (!confirm('确定要删除这个任务吗？')) return;\n\n    try {\n        const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/todos/${id}`, {\n            method: 'DELETE'\n        });\n\n        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to delete todo');\n\n        todos = todos.filter(t => t.id !== id);\n        renderTodos();\n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error deleting todo:', error);\n    }\n}\n\nfunction openEditModal(id) {\n    const todo = todos.find(t => t.id === id);\n    if (!todo) return;\n\n    editingId = id;\n    editTitle.value = todo.title;\n    editDescription.value = todo.description || '';\n    editModal.classList.remove('hidden');\n    editTitle.focus();\n}\n\nfunction closeModalFunc() {\n    editModal.classList.add('hidden');\n    editingId = null;\n    editTitle.value = '';\n    editDescription.value = '';\n}\n\nasync function saveTodoEdit() {\n    if (!editingId) return;\n\n    const title = editTitle.value.trim();\n    if (!title) {\n        alert('请输入任务标题');\n        return;\n    }\n\n    try {\n        const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/todos/${editingId}`, {\n            method: 'PUT',\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n            body: JSON.stringify({\n                title,\n                description: editDescription.value.trim() || null\n            })\n        });\n\n        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to update todo');\n\n        const updatedTodo = await response.json();\n        const index = todos.findIndex(t => t.id === editingId);\n        todos[index] = updatedTodo;\n        closeModalFunc();\n        renderTodos();\n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error saving todo:', error);\n    }\n}\n\n// Render Functions\nfunction renderTodos() {\n    // Update stats\n    const completed = todos.filter(t => t.completed).length;\n    completedCount.textContent = `已完成: ${completed}`;\n    totalCount.textContent = `总数: ${todos.length}`;\n\n    // Show/hide empty state\n    if (todos.length === 0) {\n        todoList.innerHTML = '';\n        emptyState.classList.remove('hidden');\n        return;\n    }\n\n    emptyState.classList.add('hidden');\n\n    // Sort: incomplete first, then by created date\n    const sortedTodos = [...todos].sort((a, b) => {\n        if (a.completed !== b.completed) return a.completed ? 1 : -1;\n        return new Date(b.created_at) - new Date(a.created_at);\n    });\n\n    // Render list\n    todoList.innerHTML = sortedTodos.map(todo => `\n        <li class=\"todo-item ${todo.completed ? 'completed' : ''}\" data-id=\"${todo.id}\">\n            <input \n                type=\"checkbox\" \n                class=\"todo-checkbox\" \n                ${todo.completed ? 'checked' : ''}\n                onchange=\"toggleTodo(${todo.id})\"\n            >\n            <div class=\"todo-content\">\n                <span class=\"todo-text\">${escapeHtml(todo.title)}</span>\n                ${todo.description ? `<div class=\"todo-description\">${escapeHtml(todo.description)}</div>` : ''}\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"todo-actions\">\n                <button class=\"btn-edit\" onclick=\"openEditModal(${todo.id})\">编辑</button>\n                <button class=\"btn-delete\" onclick=\"deleteTodo(${todo.id})\">删除</button>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n    `).join('');\n}\n\n// Utility Functions\nfunction escapeHtml(text) {\n    const div = document.createElement('div');\n    div.textContent = text;\n    return div.innerHTML;\n}\n\n// Expose functions to global scope for onclick handlers\nwindow.toggleTodo = toggleTodo;\nwindow.deleteTodo = deleteTodo;\nwindow.openEditModal = openEditModal;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772103214599}}
{"type":"message","id":"391a201a","parentId":"c4b00604","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:34.607Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2ea1pjaemqdu_3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/* Reset & Base */\n* {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.container {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.header {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.header h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.stats {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n}\n\n.stats .separator {\n    margin: 0 8px;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n/* Input Area */\n.input-area {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n}\n\n#todo-input {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n#todo-input:focus {\n    border-color: #667eea;\n}\n\n#todo-input::placeholder {\n    color: #999;\n}\n\n/* Buttons */\n.btn {\n    padding: 12px 20px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: #667eea;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    background: #5a6fd6;\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n    background: #e0e0e0;\n    color: #666;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n    background: #d0d0d0;\n}\n\n.btn-danger {\n    background: #ff6b6b;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.btn-danger:hover {\n    background: #ff5252;\n}\n\n.btn-edit {\n    background: #4ecdc4;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.btn-edit:hover {\n    #3dbdb5;\n}\n\n/* Todo List */\n.todo-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    max-height: 60vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.todo-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n    gap: 12px;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n\n.todo-item:hover {\n    background: #fafafa;\n}\n\n.todo-item.completed .todo-text {\n    text-decoration: line-through;\n    color: #999;\n}\n\n.todo-checkbox {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    accent-color: #667eea;\n}\n\n.todo-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    word-break: break-word;\n}\n\n.todo-description {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #666;\n    margin-left: 32px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.todo-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 0.2s;\n}\n\n.todo-item:hover .todo-actions {\n    opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.btn-edit, .btn-delete {\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-edit {\n    background: #4ecdc4;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n\n.btn-edit:hover {\n    background: #3dbdb5;\n}\n\n.btn-delete {\n    background: #ff6b6b;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n\n.btn-delete:hover {\n    background: #ff5252;\n}\n\n/* Empty State */\n.empty-state {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 60px 20px;\n    color: #999;\n}\n\n.empty-state p {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.empty-state .sub-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #bbb;\n}\n\n.hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n/* Modal */\n.modal {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 1000;\n    animation: fadeIn 0.2s;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; }\n    to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.modal-content {\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 400px;\n    animation: slideUp 0.3s;\n}\n\n@keyframes slideUp {\n    from {\n        opacity: 0;\n        transform: translateY(20px);\n    }\n    to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n}\n\n.modal-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n}\n\n.modal-header h2 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.close-btn {\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #999;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.close-btn:hover {\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.modal-body {\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.modal-body input,\n.modal-body textarea {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 12px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    outline: none;\n    font-family: inherit;\n}\n\n.modal-body input:focus,\n.modal-body textarea:focus {\n    border-color: #667eea;\n}\n\n.modal-body textarea {\n    resize: none;\n}\n\n.modal-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: #f8f9fa;\n}\n\n/* Scrollbar */\n.todo-list::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    width: 6px;\n}\n\n.todo-list::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background: #f1f1f1;\n}\n\n.todo-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background: #ccc;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n.todo-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n    background: #999;\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772103214605}}
{"type":"message","id":"3abda1e2","parentId":"391a201a","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:39.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me check the backend to understand the API structure:","thinkingSignature":"173411cb232c7eb98567c557c183b97f21f21f9c83530fbf58e85ebc25ff14d3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n52qhmf9bpmi_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/main.py"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4694,"output":47,"cacheRead":7681,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12422,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772103214607}}
{"type":"message","id":"94e6178e","parentId":"3abda1e2","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:40.017Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_n52qhmf9bpmi_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"\"\"\nTo-Do REST API - Main Application\n\"\"\"\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom typing import List, Optional\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException, Depends\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine, Column, Integer, String, Boolean, DateTime\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker, Session\n\n# CORS Middleware configuration\norigins = [\n    \"http://localhost\",\n    \"http://localhost:8000\",\n    \"http://127.0.0.1\",\n    \"http://127.0.0.1:8000\",\n    \"http://0.0.0.0\",\n    \"http://0.0.0.0:8000\",\n]\n\napp = FastAPI(title=\"To-Do API\", description=\"轻量级待办事项 REST API\")\n\n# Add CORS middleware\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=origins,\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\n# Database setup\nDATABASE_URL = \"sqlite:///./todos.db\"\nengine = create_engine(DATABASE_URL, connect_args={\"check_same_thread\": False})\nSessionLocal = sessionmaker(autocommit=False, autoflush=False, bind=engine)\nBase = declarative_base()\n\n# SQLAlchemy Model\nclass Todo(Base):\n    __tablename__ = \"todos\"\n    \n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True, index=True)\n    title = Column(String(200), nullable=False)\n    description = Column(String, nullable=True)\n    completed = Column(Boolean, default=False)\n    created_at = Column(DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow)\n    updated_at = Column(DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow, onupdate=datetime.utcnow)\n\n# Create tables\nBase.metadata.create_all(bind=engine)\n\n# Pydantic Models\nclass TodoCreate(BaseModel):\n    title: str\n    description: Optional[str] = None\n\nclass TodoUpdate(BaseModel):\n    title: Optional[str] = None\n    description: Optional[str] = None\n    completed: Optional[bool] = None\n\nclass TodoResponse(BaseModel):\n    id: int\n    title: str\n    description: Optional[str]\n    completed: bool\n    created_at: datetime\n    updated_at: datetime\n\n    class Config:\n        from_attributes = True\n\n# Dependency\ndef get_db():\n    db = SessionLocal()\n    try:\n        yield db\n    finally:\n        db.close()\n\n# Routes\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\ndef root():\n    \"\"\"Serve the index.html file\"\"\"\n    from fastapi.responses import FileResponse\n    import os\n    static_dir = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"static\", \"index.html\")\n    return FileResponse(static_dir)\n\n@app.get(\"/todos\", response_model=List[TodoResponse])\ndef get_todos(db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"获取所有待办事项\"\"\"\n    return db.query(Todo).all()\n\n@app.get(\"/todos/{todo_id}\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef get_todo(todo_id: int, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"获取单个待办事项\"\"\"\n    todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    return todo\n\n@app.post(\"/todos\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef create_todo(todo: TodoCreate, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"创建待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = Todo(title=todo.title, description=todo.description)\n    db.add(db_todo)\n    db.commit()\n    db.refresh(db_todo)\n    return db_todo\n\n@app.put(\"/todos/{todo_id}\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef update_todo(todo_id: int, todo: TodoUpdate, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"更新待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not db_todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    \n    if todo.title is not None:\n        db_todo.title = todo.title\n    if todo.description is not None:\n        db_todo.description = todo.description\n    if todo.completed is not None:\n        db_todo.completed = todo.completed\n    \n    db.commit()\n    db.refresh(db_todo)\n    return db_todo\n\n@app.delete(\"/todos/{todo_id}\")\ndef delete_todo(todo_id: int, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"删除待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not db_todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    \n    db.delete(db_todo)\n    db.commit()\n    return {\"message\": \"Todo deleted\"}\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import uvicorn\n    from fastapi.staticfiles import StaticFiles\n    import os\n    \n    # Mount static files\n    static_dir = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"static\")\n    if os.path.exists(static_dir):\n        app.mount(\"/static\", StaticFiles(directory=static_dir), name=\"static\")\n    \n    uvicorn.run(app, host=\"0.0.0.0\", port=8000)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772103220015}}
{"type":"message","id":"bcf51397","parentId":"94e6178e","timestamp":"2026-02-26T10:53:50.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a full picture of the project. Let me identify the issues:\n\n1. **Bug in app.js - The `onclick` handlers use `onchange` incorrectly**: The checkbox uses `onchange=\"toggleTodo(${todo.id})\"` which is correct, but there's also an issue with how the HTML is generated. The inline onclick handlers should work but it's better to use event delegation.\n\n2. **CSS Bug**: There's a CSS syntax error - `.btn-edit:hover { #3dbdb5; }` is invalid CSS. It should be `background: #3dbdb5;`. This appears twice in the CSS (once in a `.btn-edit` block and once at the bottom).\n\n3. **UI/UX Issues**:\n   - The edit modal doesn't show loading state\n   - No success/error feedback for user actions\n   - Empty description should still be handled gracefully\n   - Checkbox label wrapping would be better\n   - Better mobile responsiveness\n\n4. **Functionality**:\n   - The sorting might not work well if `created_at` is not consistent\n   - No confirmation before completing/uncompleting\n   - Edit modal should show current description\n\nLet me start fixing these issues. I'll rewrite the files with the fixes:","thinkingSignature":"7a960be91aadf0277f53c2a0f06c6d2fb83ac46880bdff5ea77bb2e4ebd6dca1"},{"type":"text","text":"现在我了解了项目结构。让我检查是否有服务器在运行，然后开始修复问题。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_afp0ww9rwrpp_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ps aux | grep -E \"(uvicorn|python.*main)\" | grep -v grep"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":5907,"output":318,"cacheRead":7681,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13906,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772103220017}}
